<title>USA: Premier Bancshares sets stock split.</title>
<headline>Premier Bancshares sets stock split.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Premier Bancshares Inc said on Monday it plans a 1.8055-for-1 stock split, to be distributed March 20 to common-share holders as of March 6.</p>
<p>The company currently has 2,353,779 shares outstanding. Its shares were trading at 24 on Monday.</p>
<p>Premier is a bank and thrift holding company with assets of $294.2 million.</p>
<p>	  ((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
